### =========================================================
### GENERAL ANALYSIS
### =========================================================

### 1. General Analysis - valid
POST http://localhost:5000/api/general/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "map": "Abyss",
  "year": 2024,
  "agents": [
    "cypher",
    "jett",
    "kayo",
    "omen",
    "sova"
  ]
}

###

### 2. General Analysis - missing field
POST http://localhost:5000/api/general/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "map": "Abyss",
  "year": 2024
}

###

### 3. General Analysis - invalid JSON structure
POST http://localhost:5000/api/general/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "map": "Abyss",
  "year": 2024,
  "agents": "cypher,jett,kayo,omen,sova"
}

###

### 4. General Analysis - unknown map
POST http://localhost:5000/api/general/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "map": "UnknownMap",
  "year": 2024,
  "agents": [
    "cypher",
    "jett",
    "kayo",
    "omen",
    "sova"
  ]
}


### =========================================================
### TEAM OPTIONS - YEARS
### =========================================================

### 5. Get available years
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/years
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get maps - valid year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/maps?year=2024
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Get maps - missing year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/maps
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Get maps - invalid year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/maps?year=abc
Accept: application/json


### =========================================================
### TEAM OPTIONS - TEAMS
### =========================================================

### 9. Get teams - valid
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/teams?year=2024&map=Abyss
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Get teams - missing year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/teams?map=Abyss
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Get teams - missing map
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/teams?year=2024
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Get teams - invalid year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/teams?year=abc&map=Abyss
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Get teams - unknown map
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/options/teams?year=2024&map=UnknownMap
Accept: application/json


### =========================================================
### TEAM PREDICTION
### =========================================================

### 14. Team Prediction - valid
POST http://localhost:5000/api/team/predict
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "team": "FNATIC",
  "map": "Abyss",
  "year": 2024,
  "agents": [
    "cypher",
    "jett",
    "kayo",
    "omen",
    "sova"
  ]
}

###

### 15. Team Prediction - missing field
POST http://localhost:5000/api/team/predict
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "team": "FNATIC",
  "map": "Abyss",
  "year": 2024
}

###

### 16. Team Prediction - invalid agents structure
POST http://localhost:5000/api/team/predict
Content-Type: application/json
